<title>UK: LB Sachsen adds 500 mln marks to 4-year Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>LB Sachsen adds 500 mln marks to 4-year Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, DG Bank, Dresdner Bank and Helaba.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SACHSEN</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN MARKS COUPON     4.25 PCT  MATURITY    02.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.405    PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BLN MARKS ON 25.SEPT.96</p>
<p> LISTING    STUTTGART DENOMS (K) ONE	GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
